    {
      "heading": "Overview",
      "level": 1,
      "paragraphs": [
        "This article is about the quest. For the guild hall, see Isle of the Dead.",
        "Isle of the Dead Section Primary Quests Campaign Nightfall (Elonian only) Given by First Spear Dehvad in Kamadan, Jewel of Istan (Istan) Preceded by Jokanur Diggings Followed by Bad Tide Rising Type Primary quest Map(s) Nerashi's Squad and Beknur Harbor Issnur Isles undead groups Mehtani Keys undead groups",
        "Some undead slipped out during the visit at Fahranur. Clean up the mess. This quest serves as an introduction to the southeastern areas of Istan."
      ]
    },
